font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">注意事项</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">1.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">满足参赛选手</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">全面发展</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">提升个人专业能力的需求</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">参赛选手可</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">结合自身兴趣与各赛项时间安排，参与多个赛项。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">2.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">相同比赛时间的科目，参赛选手仅限选择一个科目报名；不同比赛时间的科目，参赛选手可根据自身情况报名多个科目。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">3.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">各院校参赛师生可在赛前两周登录大赛官网报名系统，查看</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">比赛赛点</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">情况。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">4.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">参赛师生赛前一周在报名系统下载并自行打印准考证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">5.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">具体</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">比赛方式、比赛地点</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">和比赛时间以准考证公布为准。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">6.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">请各参赛院校提前安排好学生的备赛工作。如有疑问请到大赛官网</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">&ldquo;联系我们&rdquo;中咨询各省份</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">组委会</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">负责老师。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">7.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">比赛时间如有调整将在大赛官网发布，请各参赛院校及选手及时关注大赛官网通知。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 37.3333px; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">附：</span><a href=\"https://lanqiaobei-dasai.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/news/%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E5%85%AC%E5%B8%83%E7%AC%AC%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%83%E5%B1%8A%E8%93%9D%E6%A1%A5%E6%9D%AF%E5%A4%A7%E8%B5%9B%EF%BC%88%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E8%B5%9B%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E8%B5%9B%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%